      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The new update just made the action menu even worse, now I have to go through an extra menu to reach the gestures when there should be a controller binding for it like before. It's too frustrating to even enjoy the game properly any more as an Index user, I'm probably going to quit until they add a binding in.",
