  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-08T06:05:49.911Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I like the action menu for some things, but I want to be able to toggle gestures with a single button press. That's no longer possible though, since the new action menu just replaced the Toggle Gesture input.\nPlease add in another controller binding option for both Gesture Toggle and for Action Menu!",
